Package: kulan-installer
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: @PUBLISHER@ <@MAINTAINER_EMAIL@>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1 (>= 1.5), pkexec | policykit-1, util-linux, fdisk, parted, dosfstools, e2fsprogs, cryptsetup, squashfs-tools (>= 1:4.5), udev
Recommends: kulan-desktop-settings
Homepage: @HOME_URL@
Description: @NAME@ installer
 Kulan Installer puts @NAME@ on a computer in a few steps: language,
 keyboard, where to install (erase a disk, or the free space next to Windows
 or another system, optionally encrypted), time zone and account. The boot
 loader comes from the package pool on the USB stick, so no internet is
 needed. Only on the live USB stick; the installer removes itself from the
 installed system. Calamares stays available as Advanced install.
